 "strings": {
  "I want to know about you...\nTell me all about the real Kido-san.": "",
  "You're not here to discuss AD-9?": "",
  "You're more interesting\nthan some stuffy old drug.": "",
  "Right. After all... The man is more\ninteresting than his creation.": "",
  "I see.\nThis is better than I was expecting.": "",
  "I see. This is better than\nI was expecting.": "",
  "So will you tell me, big boy?": "",
  "What can you tell me, then?": "",
  "Well, there's a lot I could say, heh.\nI'm just not sure I should say it here.": "",
  "Well, eheh, there's a lot I could say...\nI'm just not sure I should.": "",
  "Huh? But it's just the two of us...\nYou can do whatever you want.": "",
  "Hmm? But it's just the two of us...\nWhy ever not?": "",
  "You're even more aggressive\nthan I expected.": "",
  "Well, it <font_kind=yakuza_italic>is</font_kind> just us...\nYou <font_kind=yakuza_italic>are</font_kind> aggressive!": "",
  "Not yet.\nWork comes first.": "",
  "Work before play, good sir.\nPatience is a virtue.": "",
  "Heh. Yes, I suppose the real\nfun can wait until later.": "",
  "Heh. Yes, I suppose the real fun\ncan wait until later.": "",
  "Well played, Saori-san.": "",
  "Nice going. Well played, Saori-san.": "",
  "I'd like to hear how AD-9 is progressing.": "",
  "Oh, that.\nI should have known...": "",
  "Oh... I should have known.": "",
  "No, no, no, no, it's all right. It's only...\nEveryone who interviews me always asks the same thing.": "",
  "No, it's fine. Everyone who interviews me\nalways asks the same questions, is all.": "",
  "I'm just going to tell you\nthe same thing I tell everyone else.": "",
  "I'd just tell you the same thing\nI tell everyone else.": "",
  "Oh... But...": "",
  "It comes with the job, yes... But I'm sick\nof parroting the same thing over and over again.": "",
  "It comes with the job, yes... but I'm sick of\nparroting the same thing over and over again.": "",
  "Kido's losing interest.\nWhat are you gonna do?": "",
  "Kido's losing interest...\nSaori-san, what next?": "",
  "What do you mean, \"what are you gonna do\"?\nMy heart's racing over here...": "",
  "...!? My heart's racing over here...": "",
  "Your heart, you say?\nLet me see...": "",
  "Hm? Your heart?\nWell then...": "",
  "Ah!": "",
  "Heh, your heartbeat\nseems normal to me.": "",
  "You're fine. Perfectly normal heartbeat.\nHeh heh heh...": "",
  "Ugh, he's even more disgusting\nthan I thought. You okay, Saori-san?": "",
  "Ugh, Kido's even more disgusting than I thought.\nHang in there, Saori-san.": "",
  "A little surprised, but yes,\nI'm okay. Thank you.": "",
  "I suppose I was just a little flustered.\nThank you for your concern.": "",
  "Oh, there's no need\nto thank me. Hahaha...": "",
  "No need to thank me.\nMy pleasure. Hahaha...": "",
  "Oh god, sorry about all this, Saori-san.\nYou're doing great, though. Keep going.": "",
  "Sorry about all this... but you're doing great,\nSaori-san. Don't let up.": "",
  "You knowww... why don't you interview <font_kind=yakuza_italic>me</font_kind> instead?": "",
  "You knowww... why don't you\ninterview <font_kind=yakuza_italic>me</font_kind> instead?": "",
  "Hold on. Something feels...\noff about all this.": "",
  "Hold on. Something about this\nfeels... strange.": "",
  "Shoot, did you come on too strong?": "",
  "Are you sure you're a journalist?": "",
  "Are you really a journalist?": "",
  "Of course!": "",
  "In that case, wouldn't it be strange\nfor me to be interviewing you?": "",
  "But then why would I interview you...?\nI'm not sure I'm following.": "",
  "Oh, um... I don't hold my liquor\nvery well. I guess I'm drunk...": "",
  "Oh, um... I don't hold my liquor very well.\nI guess I'm a little tipsy...": "",
  "Already?\nWell that just won't do.": "",
  "Already?\nWell, that just won't do.": "",
  "Aren't you hot in this? Why don't you\nlet those beauties breathe a little?": "",
  "I can do it myself!": "",
  "Yes, of course.\nGood point. Hehehe...": "",
  "Ah, yes.\nGood point. Hehehe...": "",
  "Now then... where were we?": "",
  "Now then... shall we continue?\nWhere were we?": "",
  "You should get this over\nwith as quick as possible.": "",
  "We better wrap this up quick.\nGet what we came for.": "",
  "Make your move, Saori-san.": "",
  "Saori-san, time to make your move.": "",
  "Hmmm. In that case...": "",
  "Oh... Ohhh!": "",
  "Uh... I think you're taking\nthis a little too far, Saori-san.": "",
  "That was... a lot. Saori-san,\nare you sure about this?": "",
  "I thought men liked this kind of thing.": "",
  "I thought men liked\nthis kind of thing.": "",
  "Oh, yes! I love it! I love it!": "",
  "Oh, yes! I love it!\nI love it!": "",
  "Why don't you come over\nhere and find out?": "",
  "Come a little closer...\nand find out?": "",
  "You're so adorable, Kido-san.": "",
  "Kido-san, you're just the cutest...": "",
  "I could just eat you up. ♪": "",
  "You're adorable. ♪": "",
  "Ah, ahhh!": "",
  "You can be as loud as you want.": "",
  "Awooo!": "",
  "Uhhh... Well, whatever floats\nhis boat, I guess...": "",
  "The hell was that...?\nWell, if it works for him...": "",
  "Huh? Wait, Saori-san...\nAre you... really gonna keep going?": "",
  "Huh? Uh, hello?\nSaori-san, are you still going?": "",
  "Oh, it's getting so steamy in here.\nDon't you think?": "",
  "It's so hot in here. Don't you think\nit's getting steamy?": "",
  "Yes, yes, I'm burning up!\nI totally agree with you!": "",
  "Ahhh... That's better. ♪": "",
  "Saori-san, it, uh...\nkinda seems like you're enjoying this.": "",
  "Uh... I'm not sure, Saori-san,\nbut are you enjoying this...?": "",
  "Ugh, he's the worst.": "",
  "Just wonderful. I think that's\nenough photos for now.": "",
  "Yes, just wonderful!\nNow, I think I've got my shots.": "",
  "All right, Saori-san.\nYou're good. Wrap it up.": "",
  "All right, you're good.\nSaori-san, you can wrap this up.": "",
  "How did they turn out?": "",
  "Oh, do you want to—": "",
  "Oh, do you want to— Ah!": "",
  "You're right in the frame... This is\na perfect backup. Stay strong, Saori-san!": "",
  "You're right in the frame... This is all we need.\nStay strong, Saori-san!": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Easy for him to say!\nThis is so gross! Ugh!)</color>": "",
  "You've made me a\nvery happy man today.": "",
  "You've made me a very\nhappy man today.": "",
  "Why don't we have some real fun now that\nthe interview's out of the way, my little minx?": "",
  "With the interview over, why don't we\nhave some real fun, my little minx?": "",
  "Well, um...": "",
  "W-Well, maybe, but...": "",
  "How about dinner tonight?": "",
  "In that case...\nHow about dinner tonight?": "",
  "That's perfect.\nDraw him out.": "",
  "Get him to come to Kamurocho.": "",
  "Okay.\nLet's do it in Kamurocho.": "",
  "Kamurocho? Uhm, how about somewhere else?\nI'd rather stay close by.": "",
  "Kamurocho? Er, I'd rather stay close...\nHow about somewhere else?": "",
  "Oh... I think I can convince you.": "",
  "Oh... I think I can convince you, Kido-san.": "",
  "Hm? How so?": "",
  "You'll see.": "",
  "You'll see tonight.": "",
  "Is it just me or did Saori-san start getting\nweirdly into that whole thing at some point?": "",
  "...Wow, Saori-san. Is it just me,\nor was she gettin' weirdly into it?": "",
  "Yeah, she was, uh...\nkinda scaring me towards the end.": "",
  "Yeah... She had me scared\nthere toward the end.": "",
  "Anyway. You think Kido's\nactually gonna show?": "",
  "Anyway. You think Kido's actually\ngonna come?": "",
  "He'd be a fool not to. I just sent him\nthe footage under Saori-san's name.": "",
  "He'll have to, since I just sent him\nthe footage under Saori-san's name.": "",
  "Said we'd put it online\nif he didn't show.": "",
  "Heh, guess he doesn't have a choice then.\nWhere'd you tell him to go?": "",
  "That'll do it. Guess he doesn't have a choice then.\nSo, where in Kamurocho is he?": "",
  "The batting center. Sugiura and Higashi\nwent ahead to keep an eye on the place.": "",
  "The batting center. Sugiura and Higashi\nwent ahead, to keep an eye on the place.": "",
  "What's gotten into you, man?\nI dunno if I've ever seen you this organized.": "",
  "Geez, man. I dunno if I've ever\nseen you this organized.": "",
  "I can't afford to take my time with this.\nOkubo-kun's execution date is coming up fast.": "",
  "Okubo-kun's execution date is coming up fast.\nI can't waste any time.": "",
  "Yeah, good point.": "",
  "Come on.\nWe should go.": "",
  "Come on, we should go.": "",
  "It's Sugiura.\nHey, what's up?": "",
  "It's Sugiura... What's up?": "",
  "I'm bringing the van around.\nYou see me?": "",
  "Welcome aboard.": "",
  "Get in.": "",
  "Where's Higashi?": "",
  "Already inside. I haven't noticed\nanything weird out here.": "",
  "Already inside the batting center.\nEverything's been pretty calm out here.": "",
  "Kido should be showing up any minute.": "",
  "Kido should show up any minute.": "",
  "And what happens when he does?": "",
  "We'll shove him in the van\nand drag him over to Charles.": "",
  "We'll shove him in the van,\nand bring him over to Charles.": "",
  "What, Higashi's arcade?": "",
  "Charles?\nWhat, Higashi's arcade?": "",
  "It's not like we had a lot of time\nto think about it.": "",
  "Not like we had time\nto give it much thought.": "",
  "We'll interrogate him once we get there.\nRight, Yagami-san?": "",
  "We'll interrogate Kido over there.\nSound good, Yagami-san?": "",
  "Yup. And speak of the devil.": "",
  "Surprised he actually showed.": "",
  "All right, let's move out.": "",
  "All right, show time.": "",
  "What are you doing here!?": "",
  "Wh... What are you doing here!?": "",
  "Not sure what you mean.\nMy agency's just a couple blocks away.": "",
  "What do you mean? My agency's\njust a couple blocks away.": "",
  "It's strange to see you here, though.\nWhat brings you out to Kamurocho?": "",
  "It's strange to see <font_kind=yakuza_italic>you</font_kind> here, Kido-san.\nWhat brings you out to Kamurocho?": "",
  "Er, well, I...": "",
  "Er, well...": "",
  "Maybe meeting a seductive journalist?": "",
  "Let me take a guess.\nMaybe meeting a seductive journalist?": "",
  "I understand now. You're the ones behind all this.\nWhat'll you do with that video?": "",
  "Nothing...\nIf you give us what we want.": "",
  "Nothing, if you give us what we want.": "",
  "What is it? Money?": "",
  "What, money?": "",
  "No, we're after something else entirely.": "",
  "What are you going to do to me?": "",
  "...What are you going to do to me?": "",
  "We're just taking you\nfor a little trip.": "",
  "Not much.\nJust taking you on a trip.": "",
  "No. No, I'm afraid you're not.": "",
  "No. I'm afraid you're not.": "",
  "You forget I'm a powerful man.": "",
  "You forget, I'm a powerful man.": "",
  "Hmph. Who are these assholes?": "",
  "Health Ministry thugs,\nif I had to guess.": "",
  "A mob of Health Ministry thugs,\nif I had to guess.": "",
  "Ugh. Do they have 'em all\nover the city or something...?": "",
  "The Ministry been tapping\ninto the city gutters?": "",
  "Delete that video, Yagami!": "",
  "Stay back!\nDon't come any closer!": "",
  "S-Stay back! Get away!": "",
  "Look where all that power got you.": "",
  "Nobody's running to help now.\nNot the ADDC, not the Ministry of Health...": "",
  "You're beyond the reach of the ADDC\nand the Ministry of Health...": "",
  "I've been waiting a long time for this moment.": "",
  "I've been waiting a long time for this.": "",
  "If you kill me... think what will happen to AD-9!\nTheir research will come to a screeching halt!": "",
  "If you kill me... think what will happen to AD-9!\nThe research will grind to a stop!": "",
  "Don't worry.\nNobody's killing anybody.": "",
  "Lucky for you, nobody's dying today.": "",
  "But I suggest you learn a little humility.\nI never said I wouldn't hurt you.": "",
  "But still... I suggest you learn a little humility.\nI never said I wouldn't hurt you.": "",
  "C'mon, we're outta here.": "",
  "Man, it's been a while since\nI did something like this.": "",
  "Man, it's been a while since\nI've done this stuff.": "",
  "Feels good gettin' back\nin the groove, y'know?": "",
  "Feels good gettin' back in the groove.": "",
  "You always did have a habit\nof strippin' 'em down.": "",
  "Strippin' em down was always\na nice personal touch.": "",
  "Well yeah. Everyone's the same\nunderneath all this bullshit.": "",
  "Well yeah. Everyone's the same\nunderneath all the bullshit.": "",
  "Scientist, doctor, whatever.": "",
  "Whether you're a scientist\nor some fancy director.": "",
  "Listen here. It's not too late for you.\nBut if you don't release me...": "",
  "Listen, it's not too late for you.\nBut if you don't release me...": "",
  "You'll have your assassin hunt us down?": "",
  "You'll have your assassin\nhunt us down?": "",
  "I'll take extensive legal\naction against you.": "",
  "No, moron...\nI'll take legal action!": "",
  "Hmm, who knows what'd happen if you did that?\nI might accidentally let that video loose to the press.": "",
  "I wouldn't if I were you. Otherwise, I might\naccidentally release that video to the press.": "",
  "If that doesn't sound good to you... start talking.\nYou're gonna tell us everything you know about AD-9.": "",
  "If you don't want that... start talking AD-9.\nYou're gonna tell us everything you know.": "",
  "Why me? What do you people want!?": "",
  "This is gonna be a while.": "",
  "Guess we can take turns headin'\nout to grab food.": "",
  "Guess we can take turns\nheadin' out to grab food.": "",
  "I'm ready when you are, man.": "",
  "Or you wanna rough him up\nsome more first?": "",
  "Hey, remind me what we're\ntrying to get outta him.": "",
  "Hey, remind me what\nwe're trying to get outta him.": "",
  "Where we can get proof\nof the AD-9 experiments.": "",
  "Where we can get proof of\nAD-9's human experiments.": "",
  "Whether or not we actually get\nthat proof depends on us.": "",
  "After that, it's up to us to get it.": "",
  "Who were those guys\nat the batting center?": "",
  "Well, I— er...": "",
  "You mentioned how powerful you are.": "",
  "You mentioned how powerful you are,\nif I recall.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Ah!": "อ๊า!",
  "Of course!": "แน่นอนอยู่แล้ว!",
  "Well, um...": "เอ่อ คือ...",
  "Hm? How so?": "หืม? ยังไงล่ะ?",
  "You'll see.": "เดี๋ยวก็รู้",
  "Yeah, good point.": "เออ พูดมีเหตุผลนะ",
  "Get in.": "เข้ามาสิ",
  "What are you doing here!?": "แกมาทำอะไรที่นี่!?",
  "I've been waiting a long time for this.": "รอเวลานี้มานานแล้ว"
 }
}
